  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Cipher Helmet Lock is a remarkable product designed to provide a convenient and secure solution for helmet storage. This kit contains all the non-3D printed hardware components necessary to assemble a Cipher Helmet Lock. It can be fixed onto a bicycle handle and used to lock a helmet by setting a password and inserting the helmet strap. To complete the project, you need to download the model files on MakerWorld and 3D print the parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Password-Protected:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The lock features a password-based locking system. You can choose your desired numbers as ciphers and set them in the P6 and P7 parts. The operation of setting and using the password is intuitive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Anti-Cracking Features:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The lock has an anti-cracking mode that adds an extra layer of security. When the wrong combination is entered and the lock release button P11 is pushed, the P3 part will move, preventing unauthorized access. Even if the correct numbers are turned on the cipher gears (P6 and P7), the lock will not open until the anti-cracking mode is deactivated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Assembly and Compatibility"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Comprehensive Kit: The Assembly Manual includes all standard parts and 3D print parts required for assembly. For long-term outdoor use, it is recommended to select filaments with suitable weather resistance according to factors such as ambient temperature and light conditions. - Tool Requirements: To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Tool Requirements: To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Bicycle Handle Compatibility: It can be easily attached to the steel pipe of a bicycle handle. The lock is designed to fit different handle sizes, having a default diameter of 22mm, with other sizes available to download from the author's space on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/c7f89b3d2b434482bb484ee36905dc67/ad59b70575324d36ad02b1961b66f33a.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/c7f89b3d2b434482bb484ee36905dc67/ad59b70575324d36ad02b1961b66f33a.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\">\n</video></p>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<br/>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <strong>Cipher Helmet Lock</strong> is a remarkable product designed to provide a convenient and secure solution for helmet storage. This kit contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> hardware components necessary to assemble a Cipher Helmet Lock. It can be fixed onto a bicycle handle and used to lock a helmet by setting a password and inserting the helmet strap. To complete the project, you need to download the model files on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/673253#profileId-601215\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span> and 3D print the parts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<br/><br/>\n<div class=\"pct_p\"><a><img alt=\"LED Lamp\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/951de4639db84be5b3fe3d175f461043/ZC009_3.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100vw; height: 100vh; object-fit: cover;\"/></a></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 --></table>\n<br/><br/><br/><br/><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h4 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Locking Mechanism</h4>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Password-Protected:</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">The lock features a password-based locking system. You can choose your desired numbers as ciphers and set them in the P6 and P7 parts. The operation of setting and using the password is intuitive.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/bd2452295eba4f11ab14aa2a6e67102f/1_d0c45b6f-3c9c-4be6-a0ac-6fecab4c447c.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/bd2452295eba4f11ab14aa2a6e67102f/1_d0c45b6f-3c9c-4be6-a0ac-6fecab4c447c.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Anti-Cracking Features:</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">The lock has an anti-cracking mode that adds an extra layer of security. When the wrong combination is entered and the lock release button P11 is pushed, the P3 part will move, preventing unauthorized access. Even if the correct numbers are turned on the cipher gears (P6 and P7), the lock will not open until the anti-cracking mode is deactivated.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a63150005dae4e9db1b7b58a62c3969c/APEX_aeb1b7af-d4b8-4207-983c-4b46bb99a3c9.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a63150005dae4e9db1b7b58a62c3969c/APEX_aeb1b7af-d4b8-4207-983c-4b46bb99a3c9.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><br/><br/><br/><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h4 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Assembly and Compatibility</h4>\n<br/>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Kit:</strong> The <a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/3bc223aa160948d69f0d2430fcdb2007/Helmet_Lock_Assembly_Manual_compressed.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Assembly Manual</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span> includes all standard parts and 3D print parts required for assembly. For long-term outdoor use, it is recommended to select filaments with suitable weather resistance according to factors such as ambient temperature and light conditions. - Tool Requirements: To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tool Requirements:</strong> To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bicycle Handle Compatibility:</strong> It can be easily attached to the steel pipe of a bicycle handle. The lock is designed to fit different handle sizes, having a default diameter of 22mm, with other sizes available to download from the author's space on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/673253#profileId-601215\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><br/><br/><br/>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">In the Box</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 285px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">BT2x8 SHCS Self Tapping Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">0.3x4x15 mm Helical Compression Spring</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">0.3x3x5 mm Helical Compression Spring</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1x18x15 mm WPB Helical Compression Spring</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">M6x35 SHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">6</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">M6 Carbon Steel Self Locking Hex Nut</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">7</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">M6x12x1.6 Carbon Steel Flat Washer</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The Cipher Helmet Lock is a remarkable product designed to provide a convenient and secure solution for helmet storage. This kit contains all the non-3D printed hardware components necessary to assemble a Cipher Helmet Lock. It can be fixed onto a bicycle handle and used to lock a helmet by setting a password and inserting the helmet strap. To complete the project, you need to download the model files on MakerWorld and 3D print the parts.\n\nCreator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.\n\nThe lock features a password-based locking system. You can choose your desired numbers as ciphers and set them in the P6 and P7 parts. The operation of setting and using the password is intuitive.\n\nThe lock has an anti-cracking mode that adds an extra layer of security. When the wrong combination is entered and the lock release button P11 is pushed, the P3 part will move, preventing unauthorized access. Even if the correct numbers are turned on the cipher gears (P6 and P7), the lock will not open until the anti-cracking mode is deactivated.\n\nComprehensive Kit: The Assembly Manual includes all standard parts and 3D print parts required for assembly. For long-term outdoor use, it is recommended to select filaments with suitable weather resistance according to factors such as ambient temperature and light conditions. - Tool Requirements: To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components.\n\nTool Requirements: To assemble the lock, you need a Philips head screwdriver and tweezers. These tools assist in the precise installation of various components.\n\nBicycle Handle Compatibility: It can be easily attached to the steel pipe of a bicycle handle. The lock is designed to fit different handle sizes, having a default diameter of 22mm, with other sizes available to download from the author's space on MakerWorld.",
